WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.801
A dictionary keeps values together, each under a name.

2
00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.555
Each key, in quotes, is paired with a value.

3
00:00:08.331 --> 00:00:13.481
star, points in square brackets, reads or changes the value under that key.

4
00:00:15.161 --> 00:00:18.911
Everything about one star stays together, in one place.
